.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ─── Logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log

# ─── Assets ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# assets/icon.* was previously listed here as "generated", but nothing in
# this repo actually generates them — they're the real, manually-produced
# app icon (electron-builder's mac/win/linux `icon` config points straight
# at these three files). Ignoring them meant a fresh `actions/checkout` on
# CI (build-windows.yml) never had them, so electron-builder silently fell
# back to its own default Electron icon in every CI-built .exe — must be
# committed for the real Aegis icon to ever reach a packaged build.
uploads/

# ─── Bundled OAuth credentials (auto-generated by CI — never commit) ─────────
backend/app/config/credentials.py

backend/venv2/
backend/test_httpx.spec
